	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D1:\nPorts only: no parts yet. Serial ADC on the isolated side reading the [9] outputs: I_RETURN_ADC = VMID + 0.2 V/mA and V_ELEC_ADC = VMID + V_elec/101, both sized for a 0-3.3 V input; VMID_REF (1.66 V) is available as the mid-scale reference. Channel count, resolution, sample rate, CONVST/DRDY lines and the isolated supply come with the part. Replaces the Red Pitaya slow inputs: the read-back leaves the board over SPI (ISO_MISO through [10]), J3 [5] carries no analog."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
